            "name": "Query a Big Table with SQL",
            "description": {
              "content": "Runs a SQL query (SELECT with WHERE/AND/OR and optional parameter binding) against a Big Table and returns the matching rows. When a result set exceeds the response limit a continuation token is returned. Available on Business and Enterprise plans.",
